<tr><td class="pk-card" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:32px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dadee9;border-radius:10px">
<h1 class="pk-strong" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#060912">Steam was disconnected from your Polaris Locker account</h1>
