exports[`notice templates: copy > madeFloating: subject and plain text 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "The developer removed a Mossgarden license from your account",
  "text": "The developer removed a Mossgarden license from your account

The developer of Mossgarden removed one of its licenses from your Polaris Locker account, at the request of its support. It is no longer in your library.

If you did not expect this, contact the developer's support now: they can undo it for 72 hours.

Wasn't you? Secure your account: https://key.plrs.im/#/account/methods

You are receiving this because of a change to your Polaris Locker account. We sent it to every verified email on the account.

How to secure your account: https://key.plrs.im/docs/help/secure-your-account/

What is Polaris Locker? https://key.plrs.im/docs/help/what-is-polaris-locker/

About this email: https://key.plrs.im/docs/help/emails/#license-made-floating",
}
`;

exports[`notice templates: copy > madeFloatingWaiting: subject and plain text 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "A Mossgarden license is no longer assigned to you",
  "text": "A Mossgarden license is no longer assigned to you

The developer of Mossgarden removed your name and email address from one of its licenses, at the request of its support.

If you did not expect this, contact the developer's support now: they can undo it for 72 hours.

You are receiving this because a developer issued a license to this email address.

What is Polaris Locker? https://key.plrs.im/docs/help/what-is-polaris-locker/

About this email: https://key.plrs.im/docs/help/emails/#license-made-floating",
}
`;

